971
38:37.640 --> 38:40.000
and severe coma.

972
38:40.080 --> 38:42.760
It will be hard to beat him if I don't have other preparations.

973
38:42.760 --> 38:44.160
No matter how hard it is, we have to win.

974
38:44.160 --> 38:46.690
Here, eat some walnuts to nourish your brain.

975
38:48.800 --> 38:51.000
You've worked hard these past few days,

976
38:55.280 --> 38:56.040
Lawyer Xiao.

977
38:56.520 --> 38:58.480
These past few days, I've studied this contract.

978
38:58.480 --> 39:00.610
From the first word to the last period,

979
39:00.760 --> 39:01.600
I've studied it all.

980
39:01.600 --> 39:03.520
Tell me, what problems did you find?

981
39:03.520 --> 39:05.120
There are no problems at all.

982
39:06.080 --> 39:06.840
Are you crazy?

983
39:06.840 --> 39:08.200
Then why did you bring it here?

984
39:08.200 --> 39:10.160
Uncle, this contract is too difficult.

985
39:10.160 --> 39:11.840
I studied it for three days and nights.

986
39:11.840 --> 39:13.400
My eyes are blurred,

987
39:13.560 --> 39:14.600
but I couldn't find any problems.

988
39:14.600 --> 39:17.260
Nonsense. Of course the contract is difficult.

989
39:17.360 --> 39:18.760
Even though you worked hard,

990
39:18.760 --> 39:19.560
it's still not enough.

991
39:19.560 --> 39:20.360
Take it back

992
39:20.360 --> 39:21.480
and spend another two days looking for problems.

993
39:21.480 --> 39:23.520
He won't be able to find any problems.

994
39:23.520 --> 39:25.720
This contract from the insurance company

995
39:25.720 --> 39:27.720
was reviewed by the most professional actuaries

996
39:27.720 --> 39:29.880
and the best team of lawyers.

997
39:29.880 --> 39:31.120
Every word is carefully chosen.

998
39:31.120 --> 39:33.320
How is he supposed to find any problems?

999
39:44.240 --> 39:45.440
You reminded me.

1000
39:46.240 --> 39:48.680
If it's this hard for a law student to read,

1001
39:50.720 --> 39:54.120
wouldn't it be like reading Greek to an ordinary person?

1002
39:56.640 --> 39:59.440
Mr. Han, think about it carefully.

1003
39:59.600 --> 40:02.720
Did they explain all the terms, all the diseases,

1004
40:02.840 --> 40:04.720
and all the restrictions

1005
40:04.720 --> 40:06.440
clearly to you?

1006
40:10.200 --> 40:10.720
No.

1007
40:10.920 --> 40:12.920
He only mentioned some basic points

1008
40:13.440 --> 40:15.480
and told me that if there was anything I didn't understand,

1009
40:15.480 --> 40:16.810
I could ask him anytime.

1010
40:18.600 --> 40:19.640
Is this salesman

1011
40:19.640 --> 40:21.840
still working at Shengkang Insurance?

1012
40:22.080 --> 40:22.840
He resigned.

1013
40:23.320 --> 40:25.440
But I have his phone number and WeChat.

1014
40:25.440 --> 40:26.840
Do you need me to call him?

1015
40:26.880 --> 40:27.560
No, no.

1016
40:27.680 --> 40:29.600
Let's not tip him off.

1017
40:29.760 --> 40:30.760
I'll hang up now.

1018
40:32.120 --> 40:33.440
I don't understand why you're asking

1019
40:33.440 --> 40:34.600
about that salesman.

1020
40:34.600 --> 40:35.400
Uncle,

1021
40:35.440 --> 40:37.120
the terms in the insurance contract

1022
40:37.120 --> 40:39.450
are all in favor of the insurance company.

1023
40:40.440 --> 40:42.360
I guess Lawyer Xiao wants to take the angle

1024
40:42.360 --> 40:44.960
that Shengkang Insurance failed to fulfill

1025
40:45.040 --> 40:46.440
its obligation to inform.

1026
40:46.440 --> 40:49.480
Like they say, all roads lead to Rome.

1027
40:51.080 --> 40:53.080
Rome is nice. We should go there.

1028
40:53.360 --> 40:54.760
Rome is in France, right?

1029
40:55.080 --> 40:56.140
It's in your house.

1030
40:57.640 --> 40:58.960
According to scientific statistics,

1031
40:58.960 --> 41:00.920
there is a 72% chance

1032
41:00.920 --> 41:02.480
of getting a critical illness in one's lifetime.

1033
41:02.480 --> 41:03.960
But there is only a 50% chance

1034
41:03.960 --> 41:05.160
of being cured.

1035
41:05.480 --> 41:06.480
Among that half,

1036
41:06.480 --> 41:07.600
one-third of the people

1037
41:07.600 --> 41:09.320
lack sufficient financial support

1038
41:09.320 --> 41:11.040
and have to give up treatment.

1039
41:11.880 --> 41:14.360
According to you, the Earth will soon be empty.

1040
41:14.360 --> 41:15.880
You're very humorous, sir.

1041
41:15.880 --> 41:17.720
With the continuous advancement of science,

1042
41:17.720 --> 41:19.960
more and more critical illnesses can be cured.

1043
41:19.960 --> 41:20.880
But the premise is

1044
41:20.880 --> 41:23.480
that your financial situation can cover the treatment costs.

1045
41:23.480 --> 41:24.400
Critical illness insurance

1046
41:24.400 --> 41:26.440
provides us with this kind of protection.

1047
41:26.440 --> 41:28.960
But this child is only a few months old.

1048
41:29.040 --> 41:31.520
Isn't it a bit too early to buy it?

1049
41:31.520 --> 41:32.520
Right, the child is so young.

1050
41:32.520 --> 41:33.560
It's not early.

1051
41:33.640 --> 41:34.880
I had a client last year

1052
41:34.880 --> 41:36.960
who bought this insurance as soon as their child turned one month old.

1053
41:36.960 --> 41:37.880
Early this year,

1054
41:37.880 --> 41:40.040
the child was suddenly diagnosed with acute myocarditis.

1055
41:40.040 --> 41:41.560
We paid out the claim immediately.

1056
41:41.560 --> 41:42.880
The child was just discharged from the hospital last month.

1057
41:42.880 --> 41:44.080
I even went to visit her.

1058
41:44.080 --> 41:45.960
Look, she's full of energy now.

1059
41:46.520 --> 41:48.800
She's very cute and lovable.

1060
41:49.320 --> 41:50.800
Everything is fine, miss.

1061
41:50.800 --> 41:52.520
But right now, I feel

1062
41:52.880 --> 41:54.560
that this insurance premium,

1063
41:54.560 --> 41:56.040
for our current income,

1064
41:56.040 --> 41:57.400
is a bit too high.

1065
41:57.400 --> 41:59.560
I completely understand your hesitation.

1066
41:59.560 --> 42:00.640
But think about it.

1067
42:00.880 --> 42:03.360
Getting sick is like a storm.

1068
42:03.520 --> 42:04.640
It comes without warning.

1069
42:04.640 --> 42:06.720
Buying critical illness insurance is like

1070
42:06.720 --> 42:08.720
buying an umbrella to shelter yourself from the wind and rain.

1071
42:08.720 --> 42:10.680
You might think the premium is expensive when you pay it,

1072
42:10.680 --> 42:11.920
but when you get the compensation,

1073
42:11.920 --> 42:13.160
you'll feel it's worth it.

1074
42:13.160 --> 42:15.160
This lady is so eloquent.

1075
42:15.160 --> 42:17.040
I can tell you two are very much in love.

1076
42:17.040 --> 42:18.840
Your child must be very cute too.

1077
42:18.880 --> 42:19.600
Yes, very cute.

1078
42:19.600 --> 42:20.880
He looks strong and healthy,

1079
42:20.880 --> 42:23.410
inheriting the best features from both of us.

1080
42:25.560 --> 42:26.880
Yes, well,

1081
42:27.160 --> 42:28.820
let me ask you something else.

1082
42:29.440 --> 42:30.520
A friend of mine

1083
42:30.520 --> 42:32.560
also bought critical illness insurance for his child.

1084
42:32.560 --> 42:34.480
It went smoothly when he bought it,

1085
42:34.480 --> 42:36.920
but when it came to claiming the compensation,

1086
42:36.920 --> 42:39.200
it seemed quite troublesome and difficult.

1087
42:39.200 --> 42:40.880
It's not difficult at all, sis.

1088
42:40.880 --> 42:43.440
As long as the disease specified in the contract is diagnosed,

1089
42:43.440 --> 42:45.400
or the condition specified in the contract is met,

1090
42:45.400 --> 42:46.560
we can directly pay out

1091
42:46.560 --> 42:47.040
up to hundreds of thousands in insurance money.

1092
42:47.040 --> 42:48.200
Isn't that Lawyer Xiao?

1093
42:48.200 --> 42:49.720
They pay out just like that? Yes.

1094
42:49.720 --> 42:52.040
The one next to her is her boyfriend.
